{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1720.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0f4da0a5b7488244406a49b105e5b72198b135b62672d18e30cb1332f363be13","ja":"千早たち5人は、PRのため、\nドラマのおまけ映像を撮影していて……","zh":"千早等5人为了宣传，\n正在拍摄电视剧的附赠花絮视频……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1720.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ae40f0b362c67fd3c5e4bbd44ef2cd23a6e56867b555b2d1019cf8b161deb1dd","ja":"ごきげんよう♪\nわたくしたちのドラマ、見ていただけましたかしら？","zh":"问候各位♪\n大家有看我们的电视剧吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1720.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8b7500eede9643d945b6ca2a72a9264eab68aa9931597bbd003318acd9c66330","ja":"ドラマのストーリーほどではないんですけど、\n実は私達みんな、最近不思議な夢を見ていたんです。","zh":"虽然比不上剧里的故事那般夸张，\n但其实我们大家，最近都做过不可思议的梦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1720.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"ae112d4aba024059d11ba7df86c9079748a08e93403ead7a3fcc8bd5ebacd784","ja":"そこで本日は、私達が見たそれぞれの夢を、\n即興劇で再現いたします。","zh":"因此在今天，我们将通过即兴表演，\n重现我们各自做过的梦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1720.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"ce347fe1fde93c58ec9bbff2a797ab7f7b2484d09f333a4a4426343baacc57dd","ja":"まずは私から……夢の舞台は、佐竹飯店でした。","zh":"首先由我开始……梦想的舞台，就是佐竹饭店。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1720.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"264738485bc65c0732f86771233fc02cd20c061edc593bffea8955067048ce1d","ja":"なんと……！　小さなさいずのらーめんが、\n食べても食べても運ばれてくるとは……！","zh":"居然……！小小一碗的拉面，\n不管怎么吃都能源源不断地端上来……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1720.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"cb85aa7bac6f4647fb40438704491bb0ee9044f653ab767dbcc603aa3c41215f","ja":"わんこそばならぬ、わんこらーめんですね。\nいつまでもつきないらーめんとは……真、幸せです。","zh":"这不仅是“一口碗荞麦面”，简直是“一口碗拉面”呢。\n永远吃不完的拉面……可真是无比幸福啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1720.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"e1c5a3784c8062468f7394a72f744a9d48f852a699b34e4e7d91c969766f7bd6","ja":"佐竹飯店でラーメンが次々と……。\nふふ、ありえなくもなさそうですね。","zh":"佐竹饭店里的拉面接二连三地……。\n呵呵，感觉也不是不可能呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1720.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"5e9f7ab5baf34fc773304aaea78ea369d1051392adf9e04247daf48ab0c05df5","ja":"はい。あまりに現実味を帯びておりました。目覚めて\nから、無性にらーめんが食べたくなったほどです♪","zh":"是的。实在太有真实感了。甚至到了醒来\n之后，莫名特别想吃拉面的程度呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1720.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"ae0416aeef62ba62081b168a052530b5d99f2e47e2dc602cbabd004b8d23b0db","ja":"幸せな夢を見られるなんて、うらやましいです～！\nロコは完全にバッドドリームでしたから……。","zh":"能做个幸福的梦，真让人羡慕啊～！\nROCO做的完全是个噩梦呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1720.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"b331c592bf7ee2f7d7747e6e3c9fd597e6dba2a14609db997f84a98379506df7","ja":"うぅ……アイデアが何も浮かばないです～……。","zh":"呜呜……完全想不出什么点子来～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1720.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"6ef6e2e3713f96dc5544acb90587756cbbdbb223a0b270ec49aa3d282c06109a","ja":"もうすぐ本番なのに……\nロコアートがコンプリートしません～～～～！","zh":"演出马上就要开始了……\nROCO艺术还没收集齐～～～～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
